Java --> explain the keywords in java.
         Total 53 keywords divided into 5 parts
         1.primitive datatypes --> byte short int long
                                   float double
                                   char boolean
          2. Application level 
             1. top level --> package, import
             2. type level or class level --> class interface enum new instanceof
             3. method level --> void return var
             4. oops --> this super extends implements assert
          3. access modifiers & non access modifiers
             access modifiers --> private <default> protected public
          4. exception handling --> try, catch, finally, throw, throws, try with resources
          5. logical or control statements
          
